WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Welcome to SkillrHub. Choose your learner and learning year.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Use the guide to find worksheets and understand the reporting steps.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Record worksheet learning once. Add the date, time, and support needed.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Add a short observation and a reference to your saved work samples.

5
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Review progress, then add reflections and next steps for your report.

6
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Choose a date range and print a summary for supporting evidence.

7
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.000
See dated learning records together. This demonstration uses fictional student data.
